From d74280e8044a51591e3542987b38755019a031d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <05jeelo30@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:55:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] SystemUI: Add the AxPlatform service for GameSpace

GameSpace's game panel binds to com.android.systemui.action.AX_PLATFORM
(AxPlatformClient from ax_platform_hooks) for its quick toggles, the
screenshot and screen record buttons and system state (battery, media,
keyguard, doze, configuration).

Port crDroid 17.0's implementation (from AxionOS), minus what needs the
LineageOS SDK (profiles, reading mode) or isn't in AOSPA (smart pixels):
- Labels AOSPA has no strings for are plain text.
- Disconnect the VPN through VpnManager, since AOSPA's SecurityController
  can't.
- Mobile data state has no isDefault/level, which AOSPA's
  MobileDataIndicators doesn't carry.
- Accept IRedDragonICY's GameSpace, and map its game record action to
  the regular screen recorder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
